propriate answer from the options given below :</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"Both Statement I and Statement II are correct"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Statement I is correct but Statement II is incorrect"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Both Statement I and Statement II are incorrect"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Statement I is incorrect but Statement II is correct"}],"correct_options":["D"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>Sulphanilic acid is p-amino benzene sulphonic acid</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1ldx5w5q1/1fa17808-0871-415e-8446-b37b91c38a20/57460e90-a881-11ed-99b3-79cb23978059/file-1ldx5w5q2.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1ldx5w5q1/1fa17808-0871-415e-8446-b37b91c38a20/57460e90-a881-11ed-99b3-79cb23978059/file-1ldx5w5q2.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0px auto;max-height:40vh\" alt=\"JEE Main 2023 (Online) 1st February Evening Shift Chemistry - Practical Organic Chemistry Question 61 English Explanation\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/1ldx5w5q1/1fa17808-0871-415e-8446-b37b91c38a20/57460e90-a881-11ed-99b3-79cb23978059/file-1ldx5w5q2.png?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/1ldx5w5q1/1fa17808-0871-415e-8446-b37b91c38a20/57460e90-a881-11ed-99b3-79cb23978059/file-1ldx5w5q2.png?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/1ldx5w5q1/1fa17808-0871-415e-8446-b37b91c38a20/57460e90-a881-11ed-99b3-79cb23978059/file-1ldx5w5q2.png?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/1ldx5w5q1/1fa17808-0871-415e-8446-b37b91c38a20/57460e90-a881-11ed-99b3-79cb23978059/file-1ldx5w5q2.png?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/1ldx5w5q1/1fa17808-0871-415e-8446-b37b91c38a20/57460e90-a881-11ed-99b3-79cb23978059/file-1ldx5w5q2.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/1ldx5w5q1/1fa17808-0871-415e-8446-b37b91c38a20/57460e90-a881-11ed-99b3-79cb23978059/file-1ldx5w5q2.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Since it contain both N and S so it give red colour in Lassaigne's test.</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>नीचे दो कथन दिए हैं :</p>\n<p>कथन I : सल्फैनिलिक अम्ल कार्बोक्सिलिक ग्रुप का एस्टरीकरण परीक्षण देता है ।</p>\n<p>कथन II : अतिरिक्त तत्वों की पहचान के लिए लैसें परीक्षण करने पर सल्फैनिलिक अम्ल लाल रंग देता है ।</p>\n<p>उपरोक्त कथनों के संदर्भ में, नीचे दिए गए विकल्पों से सर्वाधिक उचित उत्तर चुनिए:</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"कथन I तथा कथन II दोनों सही हैं।"},{"identifier":"B","content":"कथन I सही है परन्तु कथन II गलत है।"},{"identifier":"C","content":"कथन I तथा कथन II दोनों गलत हैं।"},{"identifier":"D","content":"कथन I गलत है परन्तु कथन II सही  है।"}],"correct_options":["D"],"answer":null,"explanation":null}},"subject":"chemistry","subjectGroup":null,"timeAllotted":120000,"topic":"detection-of-extra-elements-and-functional-groups","type":"mcq","year":2023,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":["multi_statements"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2023-online-1st-february-evening-shift","active":true},{"question_id":"1ldo21hi2","chapter":"d-and-f-block-elements","chapterGroup":"inorganic-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"easy","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","languages":["en","hi"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2023-online-1st-february-evening-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2023 (Online) 1st February Evening Shift","permalink":"pwhich-element-is-not-present-in-nesslers-reagentp-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-jo2x9qtt25brscx4","question":{"en":{"direction":null,"content":"<p>Which element is not present in Nessler's reagent?</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"Mercury"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Iodine"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Potassium"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Oxygen"}],"correct_options":["D"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>Nessler’s reagent is K<sub>2</sub>[HgI<sub>4</sub>]\n</p>\n<p>Therefore, among the options given, oxygen is the only element that is not present in Nessler's reagent.</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>नेस्लर्स अभिकर्मक में कौन सा तत्व नहीं होता है?</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"मरकरी"},{"identifier":"B","content":"आयोडीन"},{"identifier":"C","content":"पोटेशियम"},{"identifier":"D","content":"आक्सजीन"}],"correct_options":["D"],"answer":null,"explanation":null}},"subject":"chemistry","subjectGroup":null,"timeAllotted":120000,"topic":"important-compounds-of-transition-elements","type":"mcq","year":2023,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":["odd_one_out"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2023-online-1st-february-evening-shift","active":true},{"question_id":"1ldo25rd6","chapter":"biomolecules","chapterGroup":"organic-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"medium","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","languages":["en","hi"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2023-online-1st-february-evening-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2023 (Online) 1st February Evening Shift","permalink":"pgiven-below-are-two-statements--one-is-labelled-as-asser-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-kblgz3knyzefhqpb","question":{"en":{"direction":null,"content":"<p>Given below are two statements : one is labelled as Assertion (A) and the other is labelled as Reason (R).</p>\n<p>Assertion (A) : <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.448ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 640 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D6FC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D6FC\"></use></g></g></g>